Output assets/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"

Set FontSize 14

Set Width 1200

Set Height 600

Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "# MalikClaw 🦅 — Ultra-Lightweight AI Agent"

Sleep 1s

Enter
Type "malikclaw version"

Sleep 500ms

Enter

Sleep 1s
Type "malikclaw agent -m \"What is the current time?\""

Sleep 500ms

Enter

Sleep 2s
Type "malikclaw agent -m \"List files in current directory\""

Sleep 500ms

Enter

Sleep 2s
Type "# Running on <10MB RAM. <1s boot. $10 hardware."

Sleep 2s
